From 1c26dd40c66bf9fa54980082a0a2ef1f1308611c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ke=CC=81vin=20=CA=98=E2=80=BF=CA=98?= <cmoi@kevledev.fr>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 17:35:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(devcontainer): auto-seed .claude/settings.local.json on
 rebuild

Add an idempotent seed step in post-create.sh that copies
.claude/settings.local.json.example -> settings.local.json when the
live file is missing. install.sh seeds at install time; this extends
coverage to container rebuilds.

Also track .claude/settings.local.json.example via a .gitignore
counter-exclusion so the baseline ships with the repo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .claude/settings.local.json.example | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 .devcontainer/post-create.sh        | 13 +++++++
 .gitignore                          |  1 +
 3 files changed, 74 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .claude/settings.local.json.example

